    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo: The Square is a minimalist 2D platformer that focuses heavily on atmosphere and level design. As players explore various locations, they will encounter diverse challenges, solve puzzles, and progress through the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.poster.avif?t=1752996233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.webm?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.mp4?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied levels: Each level introduces new obstacles and conditions. Progression requires adapting to different challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric music: Filled with deep tones, the music subtly enhances what happens on screen and supports the overall atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design: A clean visual style supports the atmosphere and gameplay. Every element serves a clear purpose within the overall experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling storyline: This philosophical adventure invites players on a journey of profound meaning and self-discovery. As they accompany Leo through a mysterious world, they will explore deep themes, uncover hidden truths, and reflect on questions of identity and purpose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.poster.avif?t=1752996233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.webm?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.mp4?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Tim, and I'm developing Leo: The Square single-handedly to share my passion for gaming and provide players with an enjoyable experience. My approach to game development priorities delivering something unique and captivating for players to enjoy. I share details and thoughts about development on my YouTube channel.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo: The Square is a minimalist 2D platformer that focuses heavily on atmosphere and level design. As players explore various locations, they will encounter diverse challenges, solve puzzles, and progress through the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.poster.avif?t=1752996233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.webm?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/8913bf7d8ae1f94a560145dbe34e6e9b.mp4?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied levels: Each level introduces new obstacles and conditions. Progression requires adapting to different challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric music: Filled with deep tones, the music subtly enhances what happens on screen and supports the overall atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design: A clean visual style supports the atmosphere and gameplay. Every element serves a clear purpose within the overall experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling storyline: This philosophical adventure invites players on a journey of profound meaning and self-discovery. As they accompany Leo through a mysterious world, they will explore deep themes, uncover hidden truths, and reflect on questions of identity and purpose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.poster.avif?t=1752996233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.webm?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973810/extras/1fe7d982d4b06de72ec51bde6ca58a55.mp4?t=1752996233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Tim, and I'm developing Leo: The Square single-handedly to share my passion for gaming and provide players with an enjoyable experience. My approach to game development priorities delivering something unique and captivating for players to enjoy. I share details and thoughts about development on my YouTube channel.</p>",
    "short_description": "Leo: The Square is a minimalist 2D platformer where you guide Leo through challenging levels. Explore unique environments and solve puzzles in this atmospheric adventure.",
